  "facts": [
    {
      "text": "A loft has been constructed within an over-height vaulted-ceiling space in an existing dwelling. The dwelling unit is in a multi-storey and multi-family residential building. The floor assembly of the loft is attached to and is supported by the building structure and is approximately 9.6 m2 in area, measured at the floor level. The sloped ceiling above the loft ranges from 0.0 m on the low side to 1.4 m on the high side. The loft is accessed through a hatch equipped with a retractable ladder having an approximate width of 760 mm.",
      "locator": "Project description, paragraph 1"
    },
    {
      "text": "The general configuration is as illustrated below. The new loft and the access ladder are shown within Unit A.",
      "locator": "Project description, paragraph 2"
    }
  ],
